.env

# Safe local-only exclusions added by upload_raven_to_github.py
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.template
**/.netrc
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/.ssh/**
**/.aws/**
**/.azure/**
**/.kube/**
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
**/id_ecdsa
**/id_dsa
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.tfstate
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.db
**/*.dump
**/*.log
**/__pycache__/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.venv/**
**/venv/**
**/node_modules/**
**/raven_redhat_*_before.json
**/raven_redhat_*_publish.jsonl


# Editor swaps and local rollback copies are not source files.
**/*.bak
**/*.bak.*
**/*.orig
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*.pre-modified-order-*
